{#
 # Toggletip: a button ⓘ that opens a short help, a native popover (popovertarget). Unlike a Tooltip, it is reachable
 # on a touch screen and may hold rich content (a link, a list). A click or a touch opens and closes it, Escape and a
 # click outside close it. The controller toggletip also opens it on the hover and the keyboard focus, and closes it
 # when they leave; a click then keeps it open. Without the controller, the click alone.
 #
 # Props: label (required, name of the button: "Help on the field Phone"), id (required, id of the panel, unique in
 # the page). Block: content (the help). Contract: docs/components.md.
 #}
{% props label, id %}
<button {{ attributes.defaults({type: 'button', class: 'crudit-ui-toggletip', popovertarget: id, 'data-controller': '2lenet--crudit-ui-bundle--toggletip'}) }}>
    {{- ui_icon('info') -}}
    <span class="crudit-ui-visually-hidden">{{ label }}</span>
</button>
<div id="{{ id }}" class="crudit-ui-toggletip__panel" popover>
    {%- block content %}{% endblock -%}
</div>
